  throw new Error("Benchmark summary requires complete, non-comparative Full43 evidence");
}
---
<p><strong>{seconds.toFixed(3)} s Full43 engine time</strong> in the recorded October 18, 2026
  development run: {evidence.full43_calls} queries, one execution each, with
  complete values and schemas verified. This is one regression observation,
  not a matched speedup or a measurement of the published package.</p>
